{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/1JxgENtYF3DxDXMG9JdSTQ?scene=1&click_id=2114390056","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:04.889904+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/1JxgENtYF3DxDXMG9JdSTQ?scene=1&click_id=2114390056","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/NyE1c4MDkiaxeqiaYeh81ibrnkhP7eTwibhMAqUeR8RxETNTo6iaavdncdz0l3iaKBYwlz3yIDElhPkeLmQWJ3KACGWw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>“你想要的科创舞台，这里全都有！”</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>天津大学宣怀学院，将于</span><span>2026年7月18日—21日</span></span></p><p><span><span>举办</span><span>2027</span><span>级</span><span>科创硕士夏令营</span><span>活动</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>如果你是——</span></span></p><ul><li><p><span><span>具有推荐免试攻读研究生资格院校的2027届应届本科毕业生（专业排名前30%优先）；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>对科技领域创新创业具有浓厚兴趣，具有一定创造力和创业意愿。</span></span></p></li></ul><p><span><br/></span><span><span>这个</span></span><span><span>夏令营</span></span><span><span>就是</span></span><span><span>为你量身定制</span><span>的！</span></span></p><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>为什么选择科创硕士</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>在科技创新加速发展的背景下，我国深入实施创新驱动发展战略，迫切需要培养推动科技成果转化、引领新兴产业的科技创业复合型人才。天津大学宣怀学院联合多个专业学院，共同推出“</span><span>科创硕士</span><span>”项目。项目聚焦国家关键行业和重大战略需求，注重前沿技术应用与成果转化，面向电子信息、材料与化工等专业招收科创方向硕士生，打造专业教育与创业教育深度融合的创新创业人才培养体系，孵化</span><span>科技创业家</span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>申请流程</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>1、申请时间：</span><span>6月30日—7月9日中午12时</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>2、申请人需填写下述报名链接：</span></span></p><p><span><span>https://ff.lingxi360.com/f?fid=5aScSmV-6X9NT&amp;utm_bccid=LXE5aiivl0Od3xWK</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>3、完成线上申请后，申请人需同步将个人简历及相关材料发送至宣怀学院邮箱：</span></span></p><p><span><span>xuanhuai@tju.edu.cn</span><span>，具体材料包括：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（1）个人简历（一页以内）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）与创新创业实践相关的佐证材料（如有），如商业计划书、产品技术说明书、推荐信等。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>注：</span><span>以上材料请以PDF格式上传，单个文件不超过20MB；如某项材料涉及保密内容，可脱敏处理后提交，或单独说明；材料应能体现申请人在项目中的具体角色与贡献。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>4、申报说明：学生</span><span>可兼报</span><span>科创硕士夏令营与其他专业学院夏令营。若同时获得入营资格，可自主选择。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>招收专业</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>学生学籍归属于专业学院。</span><span>学生完成各培养环节并达到申请学位基本条件，可获得专业学院颁发的毕业证书和专业学位证书，并获得宣怀学院颁发的科创硕士项目证书。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/8m5Ypga0P6k2assgyqrjHxkLpC49E6ADxaMhc526XmZ0fZhMzvYLvsypxyricuia0KcU6bkFZU4hNqMrwvpyAMic18vedr076Bh4U8vmrMgbzw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>组织实施</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>1、材料初筛</span><span>。我院将根据申请人的申请材料，以科创意愿、创新创业潜质为主要评价依据，组织专家对申请者进行评审，择优确定入营的名单，并在</span><span>2026年7月12日以邮件形式通知合格入围者</span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>2、科创夏令营活动</span><span>。学院计划于7月18日—7月21日举办夏令营活动（7月18日下午报到），期间学院安排住宿及餐食。以下为夏令营主要活动：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（1）开营仪式</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）团队搭建</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）校友创业经历分享</span></span></p><p><span><span>（4）天津大学科技园参观</span></span></p><p><span><span>（5）科创综合素质展示</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>3、科创综合素质展示</span><span>。夏令营活动期间举办营员科创综合素质展示，优秀营员名单将在宣怀学院官网（https://xschool.tju.edu.cn）和“天津大学宣怀学院”微信公众号上予以公示。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>注意事项</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>1、宣怀学院夏令营举办地点为天津大学卫津路校区，入营营员原则上须全程参加夏令营活动，方有资格评选优秀营员；</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>2、申报材料及相关信息必须真实，若有造假，一经查实，将被取消参营及评选优秀营员的资格；</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>3、本次夏令营不收取报名费用；</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>4、营员入营期间发生的医疗费用及因个人行为导致的意外事故，由营员本人承担；</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>5、如因不可抗力或上级政策调整导致夏令营安排变化，学院将及时调整并另行通知，请以我院最新发布信息为准；</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>6、本活动最终解释权归天津大学宣怀学院所有。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>联系方式</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>地址：天津大学卫津路校区宣怀学院创新创业教育中心（25教学楼C304）</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>咨询电话：</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>崔老师 18920687099</span></span></p><p><span><span>孔老师 13777803408</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>工作日8：30-16：30</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>咨询微信：</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/8m5Ypga0P6kXxrFRrk4VqUiaE91AAiaMUF5x2POWQQfh2Y5A28ydPH4PpZxD1lLbNKAnnDKdA7s0aaVg34aj4PmEv8HWrv3k74uLXFVeOMA28/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>崔老师</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/8m5Ypga0P6lzrcZECjYOPokEr5K0icWTwdOW1xJg0pHZMyC2SJebmF6UARYhhibToEflAJvWpwZCAvXYd28tibltiahT2ERumjo1czSJ4rPPQDo/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>孔老师</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>同学们，准备好了吗！</span></span></p><p><span><span>这个夏天，和天大一起“创”出新高度！</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>点击“</span><span>